      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.64,
      "end_seconds": 4.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "hello, doctor. I think it's my turn"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.01,
      "end_seconds": 10.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "You're alright take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.4,
      "end_seconds": 24.91,
      "duration_seconds": 12.51,
      "text": "it's trouble falling asleep, mostly. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I've been putting this off for weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.63,
      "end_seconds": 29.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.43,
      "end_seconds": 35.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "So, ever since... since this morning, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.24,
      "end_seconds": 45.93,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.66,
      "end_seconds": 69.9,
      "duration_seconds": 22.24,
      "text": "okay so it feels moderate to me yes coffee in the evening that makes it worse i thought it would sort itself out but it hasn't and a busy mind at night too i've also been waking tired since this morning about waking tired it's moderate honestly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.15,
      "end_seconds": 81.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.53,
      "end_seconds": 85.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "I have gout, for five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.18,
      "end_seconds": 96.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.14,
      "end_seconds": 100.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.09,
      "end_seconds": 103.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.79,
      "end_seconds": 110.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.54,
      "end_seconds": 115.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "anything you do to to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.95,
      "end_seconds": 121.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.95,
      "end_seconds": 127.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.2,
      "end_seconds": 140.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "um, I'm on allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day for the gout. Febuxostat I don't take anymore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.84,
      "end_seconds": 153.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.37,
      "end_seconds": 160.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.66,
      "end_seconds": 165.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.76,
      "end_seconds": 167.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "no surgery, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.81,
      "end_seconds": 173.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.14,
      "end_seconds": 188.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "So I was told I'm allergic to cat fur but I don't remember what reaction I had."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.28,
      "end_seconds": 195.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "have you had any chest pain, snoring, weight change or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.09,
      "end_seconds": 198.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "no, I'd have said so"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.3,
      "end_seconds": 203.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.49,
      "end_seconds": 206.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.04,
      "end_seconds": 211.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.43,
      "end_seconds": 223.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.85,
      "end_seconds": 251.54,
      "duration_seconds": 13.69,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 18.2, pulse 85, BP is 127 over 68, weight 55 kilos, respiratory rate 15, height 174 centimetres, temperature is 36.6 degrees, oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.91,
      "end_seconds": 257.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a a second make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.89,
      "end_seconds": 261.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "let me feel here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.03,
      "end_seconds": 277.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Your blood pressure and pulse are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.72,
      "end_seconds": 291.58,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "good, you can sit up again. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like poor sleep habits. Mild anxiety is still possible"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.42,
      "end_seconds": 295.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.47,
      "end_seconds": 315.05,
      "duration_seconds": 18.58,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's poor sleep habits and we'll watch how it goes let me just check I've got this right you've had trouble falling asleep since this morning moderate and no chest pain or snoring"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.06,
      "end_seconds": 319.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Yes you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.86,
      "end_seconds": 333.49,
      "duration_seconds": 13.63,
      "text": "keep a fixed bedtime, no screens for an hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch book a a review in four weeks does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.9,
      "end_seconds": 336.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "That's clear thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.13,
      "end_seconds": 338.82,
